    ask_price:          "Perfect, *{city}* 📍 How much were you quoted for the procedure? Type just the amount in dollars.\n\nExample: *800*",
    ask_dest:           "Understood, *{price}* 💵 Which city or country is that quote from?\n\nExample: *Lima*, *Medellín*, *Bogotá*...",
    need_more:          "I need at least *2 quotes* to compare{nm}. You have {n}.\n\nEnter the next one: *Country - City - $Price*",
    no_useful:          "I couldn't identify the city or price{nm} 😅\n\nYou can write it like this:\n• *Medellín* (and I'll ask for the price)\n• *800* (and I'll ask for the city)\n• *Colombia - Medellín - $800* (full format)",
    comparison_header:  "📊 *Destination Comparison — Real Total Cost*\n*Procedure: {procedure}*\n\n{table}\n\n{rec}\n\nWould you like to see the *pre-trip checklist* for traveling to {best}? Type *checklist*.",
    best_saving:        "✅ *{city}* offers the best total cost, saving *{saving}* vs the most expensive option.",
    best_only:          "✅ *{city}* is your best option in total cost.",
    checklist_intro:    "✅ *Pre-Trip Checklist — {best}*\n*Procedure: {procedure}*\n\n{items}\n\n⚠️ *Important:* Confirm specific requirements with your doctor when scheduling. This list is a guide.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?",
